# SDKMAN! environment for the spec tooling — https://sdkman.io
# Install once with `sdk env install`, then activate with `sdk env` (automatic on `cd` with
# `sdkman_auto_env=true` in ~/.sdkman/etc/config).
#
# JDK 25 builds the tooling; the modules themselves target release 21, so the CLI jar it produces
# runs on any JDK 21 or newer — which is why the repository root needs no toolchain pin.
# Maven itself is not listed — use the Maven wrapper (`./mvnw`) next to this file.
#
# Keep in sync with sdk-java/.sdkmanrc.
java=25.0.1-tem
